   1029  f9de							; HOVFeatEntry — .HOVfeature tramp target ($FD7B → here). Feature-record
   1030  f9de							; dispatch for HotOverlapBody. Stack: pushed record-base Y (.HOVloop
   1031  f9de							; invariant); A = record class. Every exit tail-jmps back through a
   1032  f9de							; $FCCx pad (the pushed Y survives — HOVnext/HOVlegHit pop it).
   1033  f9de							;   $80 phase:  armed (b5) && !removed (b6) → .HOVafterGate overlap
   1034  f9de							;		 tests → shared Hot hit (bank2 latches b6, Temp b7)
   1035  f9de							;   $82 hcrunch: covered extent vs player box →
   1036  f9de							;		 HOVcKill (latch b7) → HOVlegHit (Temp b7 → LoseLife).
   1037  f9de							;		 b7 latch = kill ONCE per room visit (DropArm respawns at
   1038  f9de							;		 the death spot; the shutter is always-solid so a re-kill
