   1043  fa40							; .HOVfeature dispatch. IN: A = record class, Y = record base,
   1044  fa40							; FetchPtr = record stream (all same-bank since A3). No field pre-read and
   1045  fa40							; no stack: fields are read at (FetchPtr),base+1..4 as needed. Returns to
   1046  fa40							; HOVnext / HOVlegHit (both pop the .HOVloop base) or HOVafterGate ($80,
   1047  fa40							; which needs Y = base — the $80 path never touches Y).
