   1120  faaa							; A3 (2026-10-19): the pre-read/return tramp images are gone — PhaseBlink,
   1121  faaa							; HotOverlapBody and the HOV feature dispatcher all live in bank3 now, so
   1122  faaa							; those paths are plain local jmps. What remains here is the entry image
   1123  faaa							; fetched after a bank0/bank1 `sta $1FF9`.
